repository-code: 'https://github.com/canslab1/EpiRank'
url: 'https://github.com/canslab1/EpiRank'
abstract: >-
  A desktop application implementing the EpiRank algorithm
  for epidemic risk analysis across Taiwan's 353 townships
  based on asymmetric commuting networks. The algorithm
  models bidirectional disease spread along daily commuting
  flows using a modified PageRank approach.
